{"t": 1795077012.154301, "tool": "analyze", "code": "import numpy as np\n# test a*T^3 + b*T^r*eps^q direct fit in log-free linear regression for given exponents grid\nbest=None\nfor p in [2,3,4]:\n  for q in np.linspace(0.5,2,31):\n    for r in np.linspace(0,4,41):\n      A=np.column_stack([T**p, T**r*eps**q])\n      c=np.linalg.lstsq(A,sigma,rcond=None)[0]\n      e=np.mean((sigma-A@c)**2)/np.var(sigma)\n      if best is None or e<best[0]: best=(e,p,q,r,c)\nprint(best)\n", "out": "(np.float64(0.005071029128887311), 3, np.float64(1.75), np.float64(0.7000000000000001), array([0.0251724 , 0.24121166]))\n"}
